# Graph Chat: exact server-side aggregation tool (analyze_graphql)

Context: In an internal evaluation run, the chat model paged hundreds of
rows into its context and counted, intersected or summed them itself, and
failed most cross-condition and Genie-style aggregate questions. The new analyze_graphql tool runs the
GraphQL query server-side, pages every root list to the end, computes the
aggregate deterministically and returns only a small result table. Run
offline against a live demo graph (real executor, no LLM), it reproduced
the SQL ground truth for the cross-condition evaluation questions in 3-7 s
each.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/analysis.py (new)
   Pure aggregation logic: fetch_all_rows (re-queries each root list with
   limit/offset until a short page, capped at 20,000 rows), dotted-path
   resolution through nested lists, where conditions (=, !=, ~, >, <, >=,
   <=, and "@otherPath" for field-to-field comparison), group ranking
   (count / count_distinct / sum / avg / min / max, ties share a rank),
   set operations (intersect / difference / union) with an optional
   per-key "having" aggregate, and restrict (keep rows whose entity is, or
   is not, in another list's key set). KRW sums carry the pre-computed 억
   text. When where matches nothing, the values present are listed.
2. src/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/tools.py
   tool_analyze_graphql handler (loopback /dtwin/graphql/execute
   executor), _ANALYZE_GRAPHQL_DEF, and TOOL_DEFINITIONS / TOOL_HANDLERS
   entries. The isReturned example value is now "Y" (the real value).
3. src/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/engine.py
   System prompt changes: a TOOLS entry; route D (rankings / sums via
   analyze_graphql, never add up rows of a multi-dimension summary type);
   new route F (cross conditions via set operations, walk customer ->
   purchases / devices with restrict); new route G (data not in the schema
   -> say so, no substitute field); a revenue glossary (총매출=grossKrw,
   순매출=netKrw, 수수료=commissionKrw, 인식매출=recognizedNetKrw); a rule
   never to end a turn by announcing a further lookup.
4. .planning/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/SPEC.md
   Tool table (8 tools), analyze_graphql semantics, and a "hand-counted
   aggregates" failure mode.
5. tests/eval/datasets/agent_dtwin_chat/regression.jsonl
   Three cross-condition regression cases (questions 81, 84, 87).

